#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:42
msgid ""
"The letters of one word or words are rearranged into another. As an example:"
msgstr ""
"Bokstäverna i ett eller flera ord ordnas om till ett annat ord. Till "
"exempel:"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:43
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">AWKWARDLY</span> SILENT</tt> "
"<b>⟶</b> <tt>LISTEN</tt>"
msgstr ""
"<tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">AWKWARDLY</span> SILENT</tt> "
"<b>⟶</b> <tt>LISTEN</tt>"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:44
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here, the <b>Anagram Indicator</b> is the word <tt><span weight=\"bold\" "
"foreground=\"%s\">AWKWARDLY</span></tt>. It tells the solver to anagram "
"<tt>SILENT</tt>, resulting in <tt>LISTEN</tt>."
msgstr ""
"Här är <b>anagramindikatorn</b> ordet <tt><span weight=\"bold\" "
"foreground=\"%s\">AWKWARDLY</span></tt>. Det säger till lösaren att göra ett"
" anagram av <tt>SILENT</tt>, vilket resulterar i <tt>LISTEN</tt>."

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:48 src/edit-indicator-hints.c:203
msgid "Containers"
msgstr "Behållare"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:49
msgid "The letters of one word are placed around another. For example:"
msgstr "Bokstäverna i ett ord placeras runt ett annat. Till exempel:"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:50
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<tt>BOBSLEIGH <span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">CONTAINING</span> "
"WORKER</tt> <b>⟶</b> <tt>SLANTED</tt>"
msgstr ""
"<tt>BOBSLEIGH <span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">CONTAINING</span> "
"WORKER</tt> <b>⟶</b> <tt>SLANTED</tt>"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:51
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here,  <tt>BOBSLEIGH</tt> is a synonym for <tt>SLED</tt> and a "
"<tt>WORKER</tt> is an <tt>ANT</tt>. The phrase <tt><span weight=\"bold\" "
"foreground=\"%s\">RIDING</span></tt> is the <b>Container Indicator</b>. It "
"tells the solver to put the first word around the second, resulting in "
"<tt>SL(ANT)ED</tt>."
msgstr ""
"Här är <tt>BOBSLEIGH</tt> en synonym för <tt>SLED</tt> och en "
"<tt>WORKER</tt> är en <tt>ANT</tt>. Frasen <tt><span weight=\"bold\" "
"foreground=\"%s\">RIDING</span></tt> är <b>behållarindikatorn</b>. Den säger"
" till lösaren att sätta det första ordet runt det andra vilket resulterar i "
"<tt>SL(ANT)ED</tt>."

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:56
msgid ""
"Letters are removed from a word or phrase to reveal another. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Bokstäver tas bort från ett ord eller en fras för att visa ett annat. Till "
"exempel:"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:57
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<tt>DOCTOR <tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">LEAVING</span></tt> "
"DAMAGED</tt> <b>⟶</b> <tt>HARD</tt>"
msgstr ""
"<tt>DOCTOR <tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">LEAVING</span></tt> "
"DAMAGED</tt> <b>⟶</b> <tt>HARD</tt>"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:58
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here, a shorthand term for <tt>DOCTOR</tt> is <tt>ME</tt> (<b>M</b>edical "
"<b>E</b>xaminer), and <tt>DAMAGED</tt> is a synonym for <tt>HARMED</tt>. "
"<tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">LEAVING</span></tt> is the "
"<b>Deletion Indicator</b>. Deleting the first term from the second results "
"in <tt>HAR(<s>ME</s>)D</tt>."
msgstr ""
"Här är en förkortning för <tt>DOCTOR</tt> <tt>ME</tt> (<b>M</b>edical "
"<b>E</b>xaminer), och <tt>DAMAGED</tt> är en synonym för <tt>HARMED</tt>. "
"<tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">LEAVING</span></tt> är "
"<b>borttagningsindikatorn</b>. Att ta bort den första termen från den andra "
"resulterar i <tt>HAR(<s>ME</s>)D</tt>."

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:62 src/edit-indicator-hints.c:205
msgid "Hidden Words"
msgstr "Dolda ord"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:63
msgid "Wordplay where a longer phrase hides an inner word. For example"
msgstr "Ordlek där en längre fras döljer ett inre ord. Till exempel"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:64
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">CAUGHT</span> CHAD ESCAPING</tt>"
" <b>⟶</b> <tt>HADES</tt>"
msgstr ""
"<tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">CAUGHT</span> CHAD ESCAPING</tt>"
" <b>⟶</b> <tt>HADES</tt>"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:65
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here, <tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">CAUGHT</span></tt> is the "
"<b>Hidden Word Indicator</b>. It tells the solver that the answer can be "
"found within <tt>C<u>HAD ES</u>CAPING</tt>."
msgstr ""
"Här är <tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">CAUGHT</span></tt> "
"<b>dolt ord-indikatorn</b>. Den säger till lösaren att svaret kan hittas i "
"<tt>C<u>HAD ES</u>CAPING</tt>."

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:69 src/edit-indicator-hints.c:206
msgid "Homophones"
msgstr "Homofoner"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:70
msgid "A words indicates another that sounds alike. For example:"
msgstr "Ett ord indikerar ett annat som låter likadant. Till exempel:"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:71
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<tt>EARNINGS <span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">REPORT</span></tt> "
"<b>⟶</b> <tt>PROPHET</tt>"
msgstr ""
"<tt>EARNINGS <span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">REPORT</span></tt> "
"<b>⟶</b> <tt>PROPHET</tt>"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:72
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here, the word <tt>EARNINGS</tt> is a synonym for <tt>PROFIT</tt> and "
"<tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">REPORT</span></tt> is the "
"<b>Homophone Word Indicator</b>. It tells the solver that the answer sounds "
"like <tt>PROFIT</tt> (eg. <tt>PROPHET</tt>)."
msgstr ""
"Här är ordet <tt>EARNINGS</tt> en synonym för <tt>PROFIT</tt> och <tt><span "
"weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">REPORT</span></tt> är "
"<b>homofonordsindikatorn</b>. Den säger till lösaren att ordet låter som "
"<tt>PROFIT</tt> (t.ex. <tt>PROPHET</tt>)."

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:76 src/edit-indicator-hints.c:207
msgid "Insertions"
msgstr "Infogningar"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:77
msgid "The letters of one word are placed inside another. For example:"
msgstr "Bokstäverna i ett ord placeras inuti ett annat. Till exempel:"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:78
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<tt>TIME <span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">TO KEEP</span> VISION</tt> "
"<b>⟶</b> <tt>OPERATIC</tt>"
msgstr ""
"<tt>TIME <span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">TO KEEP</span> VISION</tt> "
"<b>⟶</b> <tt>OPERATIC</tt>"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:79
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here, <tt>ERA</tt> is a measurement of <tt>TIME</tt> and <tt>VISION</tt> "
"refers to <tt>OPTIC</tt>. The phrase <tt><span weight=\"bold\" "
"foreground=\"%s\">TO KEEP</span></tt> is the <b>Insertion Indicator</b>. It "
"tells the solver to put the first word inside the second, resulting in "
"<tt>OP(ERA)TIC</tt>."
msgstr ""
"Här är <tt>ERA</tt> en mängd <tt>TIME</tt> och <tt>VISION</tt> hänvisar till"
" <tt>OPTIC</tt>. Frasen <tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">TO "
"KEEP</span></tt> är <b>infogningsindikatorn</b>. Den säger till lösaren att "
"sätta det första ordet i det andra ordet, vilket resulterar i "
"<tt>OP(ERA)TIC</tt>."

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:82 src/edit-indicator-hints.c:208
msgid "Reversals"
msgstr "Omvändningar"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:83
msgid ""
"A word or phrase is reversed direction, revealing another. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Ett ord eller en fras ändrar riktning vilket avslöjar ett annat ord. Till "
"exempel:"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:84
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<tt>STOP <span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">GOING EAST</span></tt> "
"<b>⟶</b> <tt>POTS</tt>"
msgstr ""
"<tt>STOP <span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">GOING EAST</span></tt> "
"<b>⟶</b> <tt>POTS</tt>"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints-text.c:85
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here, the phrase <tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">GOING "
"EAST</span></tt> is the <b>Reversal Indicator</b> for the solver to reverse "
"the direction of <tt>STOP</tt>, resulting in <tt>POTS</tt>. Note that this "
"phrase only works for across clues. For down clues, <tt><span "
"weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">HEADING NORTH</span></tt> might be a "
"better indicator."
msgstr ""
"Här är frasen <tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">GOING "
"EAST</span></tt> <b>omvändningsindikatorn</b> för lösaren för att vända "
"riktningen på <tt>STOP</tt>, vilket resulterar i <tt>POTS</tt>. Observera "
"att denna fras endast fungerar för vågräta ledtrådar. För lodräta ledtrådar "
"kan <tt><span weight=\"bold\" foreground=\"%s\">HEADING NORTH</span></tt> "
"vara en bättre indikator."

#: src/edit-indicator-hints.blp:7 src/edit-indicator-hints.blp:14
#: src/edit-indicator-hints.blp:62 src/edit-indicator-hints.blp:85
msgid "Wordplay Indicators"
msgstr "Ordleksindikatorer"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints.blp:38
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Översikt"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints.blp:43
msgid ""
"Clues in <b>Cryptic crosswords</b> rely heavily on wordplay to lead the "
"solver to an answer. Traditionally, clues use <b>Wordplay Indicator</b> to "
"signal what kind of wordplay is being used. These words act as signposts, "
"telling the solver how to manipulate parts of the clue to find the solution."
msgstr ""
"Ledtrådar i <b>kryptiska korsord</b> förlitar sig mycket på ordlekar för att"
" leda lösaren till ett svar. Traditionellt använder ledtrådar en "
"<b>ordleksindikator</b> för att signalera vilken sorts ordlek som används. "
"Dessa ord fungerar som vägvisare som berättar för lösaren hur delar av "
"ledtråden ska manipuleras för att hitta lösningen."

#: src/edit-indicator-hints.blp:51
msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "Instruktioner"

#: src/edit-indicator-hints.blp:56
msgid ""
"Each section below leads to a selection of commonly used wordplay "
"indicators. They can be used to spur creativity when writing clues. They "
"also contain a full list of frequently used indicators, sorted by "
"popularity. The more popular an indicator is, the more likely it is to be "
"familiar to the solver."
msgstr ""
"Varje avsnitt nedan leder till ett urval av vanligen använda "
"ordleksindikatorer. De kan användas för att hjälpa kreativiteten vid "
"skrivande av ledtrådar. De innehåller också en fullständig lista över "
"frekvent använda indikatorer, sorterade efter popularitet. Ju populärare en "
"indikator är, desto mer troligt är den att vara bekant för lösaren."

#: src/edit-indicator-hints.blp:74
msgid ""
"Data sourced from the <a href=\"https://cryptics.georgeho.org/\">George Ho "
"dataset</a> of cryptic crosswords"
msgstr ""
"Data härstammar från <a href=\"https://cryptics.georgeho.org/\">George Ho-"
"uppsättningen</a> med kryptiska korsord"

